        "id": 1003247
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-30T08:56:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder why you do the counting on downstream\u003dtrue, but not the reverse (ie. on false) - or even on both.  Does it matter?\n\nThe current implementation doesn\u0027t seem to actually match the comments (which talk about rules on upstream interface, not rules redirecting packets to upstream interface).\n\nShould this be reversed?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 335,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 342,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "2fccaf5c956fc69880030b52882148905c6e8fff",
